# Generated docs are byte/line compared against LF-generated content by freshness
# gates (decoder/hardware_matrix_test.go, decoder/capability_matrix_test.go). Pin
# them to LF so a Windows checkout — or a Windows `-update` regeneration — stays LF
# instead of fighting git's autocrlf smudge filter. The gates also strip CR before
# comparing (stripCR), so this is defense in depth, not the sole guard.
docs/hardware-matrix.md      text eol=lf
docs/capability-matrix.md    text eol=lf
docs/capability-matrix.json  text eol=lf
